com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfztxNb5b15U05ZLiPyFKAXmQpvGv3uiYcv6zwyIdMvbBQ&oe=69B7F2CD"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1021011425999827", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_1021011429333160_4176289926510597494_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QWWM-lOYJaQQ7kNvwH9JgqN&_nc_oc=AdmLSzxLHi6oI15caXHPRibWlTZ995gOxUCxjfeH3kQJdjNJLf42q6kdx0vMGG2D5K4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyfGacg-tAUb2cpPLq7ZUoWKXBT0qCnk4ansMiLrsfUpQ&oe=69B7E861"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 4.png", "id": "524012790104112", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001669_524012793437445_4891316513078544414_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZO_QCMnVtsMQ7kNvwEjKeP7&_nc_oc=Adnqv2nUjgx8IigvF3K6dW3ljh3wdCWUwi30RwNWlv6D6qd9JXKyempxqB-NlC2l3wU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz0ej5NImqoSs13_yj2lGmOnyZlMmNiSIH42QJq_PpzHA&oe=69B7FCDA"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "1187574142495669", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1187574145829002_8495108821353233334_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ESzJbRQ9P3wQ7kNvwGTCkme&_nc_oc=AdlHsvz_d9BGJNXSf_vhXtOO8nYzwjaAiQ7JVmB7qicfbPzXbiDt33NqZMwUOmn8Jgs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzckDfeXL1eWngZA5ufU7fuDe9pYKUuHVXyD2ELPXcsAA&oe=69B7EF70"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "529809686395654", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476759_529809689728987_2021663405477506286_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ak22DcfRHPwQ7kNvwGVXhLA&_nc_oc=Adn3vEe1OousI3KIXT5-x0m9u2XxHYMKifOo7B_w3nCta2CzzIFb7vaFWn1WQugi2AY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxAB87c13RQIZIJn-g7HVsL47IdKVUxbr5C528xbr5-8A&oe=69B7E17F"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that allows you to explore cell structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape Mini.png", "id": "2930927027073306", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974477_2930927030406639_1033799740283778117_n.